// SYNTAX TEST "source.simula" "simtst64"
% =======================================   Main   program =============
// <------------------------------------------------------------------------ comment.directive
%  PROGRAM NAME:   Simula a.s. - SIMULA TEST NO 64
// <-------------------------------------------------- comment.directive
